    <briefdescription>
<para>Radial <ref refid="classBasis" kindref="compound">Basis</ref> Function kernel. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Defined for two vectors <bold>x</bold> and <bold>y</bold>:</para>
<para><formula id="40">\[ K(\mathbf{x}, \mathbf{y}) = \exp\Big( -\frac{||\mathbf{x}-\mathbf{y}||^2} {2\sigma^2} \Big) \]</formula></para>
<para>Required <ref refid="classConfig" kindref="compound">Config</ref> key: <ref refid="classConfig_1MPARAMS" kindref="member">MPARAMS</ref> &lt;double&gt; <formula id="41">$ \sigma $</formula></para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classKern__Base" kindref="compound">Kern_Base</ref> <ref refid="classKern__Linear" kindref="compound">Kern_Linear</ref> <ref refid="classKern__Quadratic" kindref="compound">Kern_Quadratic</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
